{"id":"H5893","lemma":"עִיר","transliteration":"ir","sayIt":"ir","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Ir","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of the Patriarchs, only mentioned at 1Ch.7.12;\nfather of: Shuppim (H8206), Huppim (H2650), Maacah (H4601M)\n§ Ir = \"belonging to a city\"\nson of Bela and father of Huppim and Shuppim","glosses":["ir"],"count":2,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-10","v":11,"renderings":{}},{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ir","kjv":"of Ir"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 10:11","note":"Out of that land he went into Assyria, and built Nineveh, Rehoboth Ir, Calah,","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 7:12","note":"So were Shuppim, Huppim, the sons of Ir, Hushim, and the sons of Aher.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H2650","lemma":"חֻפִּים","transliteration":"chuppim","gloss":"Huppim"},{"id":"H4601","lemma":"מַעֲכָה","transliteration":"maakhah","gloss":"Maacah"},{"id":"H8206","lemma":"שֻׁפִּים","transliteration":"shuppim","gloss":"Shuppim"},{"id":"H7344","lemma":"רְחֹבוֹת","transliteration":"rechovot","gloss":"Rehoboth"},{"id":"H5210","lemma":"נִינְוֵה","transliteration":"ninveh","gloss":"Nineveh"}],"senses":[{"id":"H5893H","gloss":"(Rehoboth)-Ir  ","relation":"H5893H = a Part of"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}